 "_about": "Round 40 (Robert: 'meridian cleansing that needs to be done both for major and minor nodes; this amplifies the base stats of the player, a percentage boost -- figure out a fair metric'). MINOR NODES are the 36 points of the Meridian Lattice (open one first, K). MAJOR NODES are twelve great points that open with your realm. Every node is cleansed through five grades -- murky, clouded, clear, pure, radiant -- by meditating with Cleanse as your focus (or a share of it). THE METRIC: each stat has a ceiling (health +30%, damage +30%, speed +15%, strike speed +15%, defense 20% less damage, qi +30%, recovery +30%). The ceiling is shared among the nodes that feed that stat by weight (a minor node 1, a major node 4, the two crown nodes 2 to every stat); a node gives its share times its grade (0, 20%, 45%, 70%, 100%). So every node matters, the big ones matter more, and everything clean is exactly the ceiling -- never more.",
